# PSR-4b-api-deps-sync — API package.json generate/sync writer

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Inventory + exact-set ratchet (prior wave) | Yes ([`psr-4b-api-deps`](./psr-4b-api-deps.mdoc)) |
| `syncApiPackageJson` / `verifyApiPackageJson` (I.8 mirror) | Yes |
| Wire into `generate:workspace-registry` (+ `--check`) | Yes |
| Guard uses verify writer (sorted exact deps) | Yes |
| Unit spec for helpers | Yes |
| Delete fixture finance/booking deps | **No** (deferred) |
| Absorb `http/configure-*` | **No** (PSR-4b-configure) |

## Why this wave

PSR-4 §5: `apps/api/package.json` product membership should generate/sync from
manifests. Prior wave locked exact-set equality without a writer. Membership was
already correct; this wave removes the manual edit path.

## API vs admin web

| Host | Product set | Dep section |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `apps/web` (I.8) | Product trunk only (skips `registryOnly`) | `devDependencies` |
| `apps/api` (this wave) | **All** manifest packages (includes fixtures) | `dependencies` |

`workspace-sdk` is preserved on both; never treated as a product dep.

## Writer behavior

1. Strip `@app-tour/workspace-*` except `workspace-sdk` / `workspace-plugin-host`.
2. Add every `workspace.manifest.json` `package` as `workspace:*`.
3. Sort dependency keys deterministically.
4. Idempotent — no write when already synced.

**Side effect of first sync:** `apps/api/package.json` previously contained a
duplicate `scripts.prebuild` key (invalid JSON; Node kept the last value —
`build-api-workspace-deps.sh` + `generate:workspace-registry`). Rewrite emits a
single `prebuild` entry matching that effective value.

## Local verification

```bash
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry -- --check
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-api-deps-smoke.mjs
pnpm run guard:host-workspace-deps
node --test scripts/test/api-host-product-deps.spec.mjs
```

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| generate sync + `--check` green | required |
| guard + smoke green | required |
| unit helpers green | required |
| No fixture dep deletion | required |
